When creating or materially editing Control Plane UI or `@vector/ui` identity tokens, first read `docs/28_VECTOR_HERO_AND_PRODUCT_VISUAL_LANGUAGE.md` and `docs/frontend/VECTOR_FRONTEND_MAP.md`.

Reuse existing Vector tokens and Control primitives. Do not hard-code recurring brand hex, radius, or motion values in routes.

This identity does not apply to Delivery client sites. Do not import Control tokens into `apps/delivery`. Do not replace client heroes with the Vector signal-to-growth graph. Authenticated client outcome screens (`docs/30`) use these tokens and outcome-first copy; they are not a second visual language.

Control stays operational: no MGE cream/cinema, no decorative network meshes, no mint as a generic accent.

Preserve keyboard access, visible focus, and `prefers-reduced-motion`. Do not redesign unrelated routes. Update `docs/frontend/VECTOR_COMPONENT_INVENTORY.md` when adding a reusable Control component.
